006","quote":"周文，陳之賢人也，嘗為項燕軍視日，事春申君，自言習兵，陳王與之將軍印，西擊秦。行收兵至關，車千乘，卒數十萬，至戲，軍焉。秦令少府章邯免酈山徒、人奴產子生，悉發以擊楚大軍，盡敗之。周文敗，走出關，止次曹陽二三月。章邯追敗之，復走次澠池十余日。章邯擊，大破之。周文自剄，軍遂不戰。"}],"rationale":"限明示名、字及局部軍事角色；陳勝涉、吳廣叔、蔡賜房君與周文周章暫接，吳廣韓廣分開。引文四君短稱及比擬人物另留候選，詐稱扶蘇項燕不合陳吳，褚賈署稱不補姓名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:p006","text":"周文，陳之賢人也，嘗為項燕軍視日，事春申君，自言習兵，陳王與之將軍印，西擊秦。行收兵至關，車千乘，卒數十萬，至戲，軍焉。秦令少府章邯免酈山徒、人奴產子生，悉發以擊楚大軍，盡敗之。周文敗，走出關，止次曹陽二三月。章邯追敗之，復走次澠池十余日。章邯擊，大破之。周文自剄，軍遂不戰。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m006-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"周文","kind":"person","person_id":"g6k_27w_gan","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m006-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"項燕","kind":"person","person_id":"xo7_4es_usf","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m006-0018","start":18,"end":21,"surface":"春申君","kind":"person","person_id":"418_6k8_181","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m006-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"陳王","kind":"person","person_id":"t9r_yzu_a41","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m006-0064","start":64,"end":66,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"2j9_c6k_fjs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m006-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"周文","kind":"person","person_id":"g6k_27w_gan","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m006-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"2j9_c6k_fjs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m006-0120","start":120,"end":122,"surface":"章邯","kind":"person","person_id":"2j9_c6k_fjs","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe:m006-0128","start":128,"end":130,"surface":"周文","kind":"person","person_id":"g6k_27w_gan","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-048-chenshe","book_id":"b-shiji-04